    "text": "AWS Unveils AI Agent Marketplace as ‘One-Stop Shop’ for Enterprise Deployment\nBy PYMNTS,\n10 hours agoAnnounced at the AWS Summit New York City on Wednesday (July 16), “AI Agents and Tools” is a new category in the AWS Marketplace. It debuts with more than 900 agents and related support on tap from providers including Anthropic, Salesforce, IBM, PwC, Stripe, Perplexity, Automation Anywhere and C3.ai.",
